   transpose(conj(v[..., :, :]))`

  ```python
  # a is a tensor.
  # s is a tensor of singular values.
  # u is a tensor of left singular vectors.
  # v is a tensor of right singular vectors.
  s, u, v = svd(a)
  s = svd(a, compute_uv=False)
  ```

