    * The order of output  arguments here is `s`, `u`, `v` when `compute_uv` is
      `True`, as opposed to `u`, `s`, `v` for numpy.linalg.svd.
    * full_matrices is `False` by default as opposed to `True` for
       numpy.linalg.svd.
